 AI is changing how managers evaluate employees, report shows 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 When AI-polished work lands on a manager’s desk, it’s hard to see who, or what, actually did it, according to a new AI report.


 The impact: 78% of senior leaders have changed how they evaluate team members since adopting AI, while 47% spend more time reviewing output.


