 4. Training data 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Meta announced Muse Ember, a smaller model it says is more cost-effective than OpenAI's Luna or Anthropic's Haiku models. CEO Mark Zuckerberg said that Embar and another Muse model are also being made available via Google's cloud. (TechCrunch) Anthropic updated its high-end Fable and Mythos models, with version 5.2. The release comes as the company looks to complete its IPO as soon as next week. (Bloomberg) 
 
